(+) `cloud-itonami-isic-5819` now has a real, tested implementation
matching the shape of every other cloud-itonami ISIC actor, replacing a
`:spec` placeholder pointing at a repo that never existed.

(+) `kotoba-lang/industry` registry `\"5819\"` entry promoted to
`:maturity :implemented`.

(+) This actor is another concrete example of Wave 4's
person-facing-service safety guardrail applied to the publishing
